OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds of wildflowers to be
OL,4,Aplanted at meadow
OL,5,
OL,6,FA project to preserve vulnerable
OL,7,Fvegetation and wildlife will see
OL,8,Fhundreds of wildflower plants
OL,9,Fintroduced to an upland hay meadow.
OL,11,FFriends of the Lake District (Fold)
OL,12,Fwants to plant 1,500 wildflowers on
OL,13,Fland at Mazonwath, in Little Asby,
OL,14,FCumbria, to help reintroduce many
OL,15,Fnative species lost through some
OL,16,Ffarming practices.
OL,18,FA spokesperson for the environmental
OL,19,Fcharity said plant roots were good for
OL,20,Fmoisture retention and soil health,
OL,21,Fwith their texture playing a part in
OL,22,Fslowing the flow of overland water.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
